{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Whitehead 塔"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Whitehead塔"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>带基点"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $*\\to X$ 的 Whitehead 塔是对映射 $*\\to X$ 作 "},{"Local":{"url":"连通-截断分解","text":"($n$-连通, $n$-截断) 分解"}},{"Plain":"所得的序列\n$$\r\n*\\to \\cdots \\to Z_2 \\to Z_1 \\to Z_0 \\to Z_{-1} \\to Z_{-2} =X,\r\n$$\n满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$*\\to Z_n$ 是 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"映射, 也即 $Z_n$ 是 $(n+1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"生象;</li>\n<li>$Z_n\\to X$ 是 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"映射.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>纤维</h3>\n<p>记号如上. 映射 $Z_n\\to Z_{n-1}$ 的纤维为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Eilenberg–MacLane空间","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane 空间"}},{"Plain":" $K(\\pi_{n+1}(X),n)$.</p>\n<h3>一种显式构造</h3>\n<p>$Z_n$ 的一种显式构造为 $\\mathbf{B}^{n+2}\\Omega^{n+2}X$.</p>\n<h3>与截断的关系</h3>\n<p>$Z_n$ 是如下的拉回.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\tZ_n &amp; \\to &amp; *\\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\tX &amp; \\to &amp; \\tau_{\\leq n+1} X.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$n=-1$:</p>\n<p>$Z_{-1}\\to X$ 是基点处的连通分支.</p>\n<p>$n=0$:</p>\n<p>$Z_0 \\to Z_{-1}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"万有覆叠","text":"万有覆叠"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>正交群</h3>\n<p>正交群 $\\mathrm{O}_n$ 的 Whitehead 塔为\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\to \\text{String}_n \\to \\mathrm{Spin}_n \\to \\mathrm{SO}_n \\to \\mathrm{O}_n.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 塔"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}